Function:
public class ConvertBase {
public static long convertBase(long value, int base, int newBase){
        long result = value;
        if (newBase!=base){
            result = Double.valueOf((double) value * Math.pow(10, base - newBase)).longValue();
        }
        return result;
    }
}

Test Case:
